{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Realms is a sandbox MMO game where you can gather resources and make your own realms! You can fight enemies, complete quests, craft items, make friends and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/extras/654fe35864790322297e1a434a952ab7.avif?t=1758831638\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and share your dream realms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost everything in this game is player created. You have the tools to build anything you can imagine and instantly share it with other players. Create thrilling parkour challenges, dazzling pixel artworks, immersive stories, hilarious minigames, and more. Whether you're a builder, a storyteller, or just here to hang out: Crystal Realms has you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/extras/27df3140100f735ec309c96042eca803.avif?t=1758831638\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends make any adventure better</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, compete and collaborate with others from around the globe. Forge new friendships, flex your skills or host show-stopping events. Our community is what makes Crystal Realms an amazing game, so go out and be a part of it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/extras/7fac8be0094ac99f1f3885cf22bed456.avif?t=1758831638\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face danger in hopes to claim loot </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are lurking behind every corner: Silly slimes, cursed mummies, strong copper golems and more! And if you are looking for a bigger challenge, Crystal Realms has it too: Dodge traps and fight goblins while skillfully sweeping loot inside the action-packed Goblin hideouts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing together with you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to our skilled and dedicated dev team, Crystal Realms is always evolving. Come back every few weeks to see what\u2019s new! The game will receive continued support and new features even after release, we hope you\u2019ll join us in this amazing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Cosmic Shark games</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054990?t=1758831638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054990?t=1758831638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/46b2bb57afb12f8db53300b1fa185c3c45baa356/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758831638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/46b2bb57afb12f8db53300b1fa185c3c45baa356/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758831638","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Realms is a sandbox MMO game where you can gather resources and make your own realms! You can fight enemies, complete quests, craft items, make friends and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/extras/654fe35864790322297e1a434a952ab7.avif?t=1758831638\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and share your dream realms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost everything in this game is player created. You have the tools to build anything you can imagine and instantly share it with other players. Create thrilling parkour challenges, dazzling pixel artworks, immersive stories, hilarious minigames, and more. Whether you're a builder, a storyteller, or just here to hang out: Crystal Realms has you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/extras/27df3140100f735ec309c96042eca803.avif?t=1758831638\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends make any adventure better</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, compete and collaborate with others from around the globe. Forge new friendships, flex your skills or host show-stopping events. Our community is what makes Crystal Realms an amazing game, so go out and be a part of it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/extras/7fac8be0094ac99f1f3885cf22bed456.avif?t=1758831638\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face danger in hopes to claim loot </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are lurking behind every corner: Silly slimes, cursed mummies, strong copper golems and more! And if you are looking for a bigger challenge, Crystal Realms has it too: Dodge traps and fight goblins while skillfully sweeping loot inside the action-packed Goblin hideouts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing together with you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to our skilled and dedicated dev team, Crystal Realms is always evolving. Come back every few weeks to see what\u2019s new! The game will receive continued support and new features even after release, we hope you\u2019ll join us in this amazing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Cosmic Shark games</p>","developers":["Cosmic Shark Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054990/362003d16924320a7d5776063a9a1dcfe1c662b9/header.jpg?t=1758831638","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4054990/241020341/0df3359be139875b7f00089df494c552c45bd81a/1758825357/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758827131","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4054990/241020341/0df3359be139875b7f00089df494c552c45bd81a/1758825357/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758827131","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4054990/241020341/0df3359be139875b7f00089df494c552c45bd81a/1758825357/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758827131","id":257204151,"name":"Alpha trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204151/fcb90b0472183908defec7b7a900e9c0a55a3f51/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758827131"}],"name":"Crystal Realms","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<